* Work has been especially demanding — barely any free time for study.
* Managed to spend ~1 hour each day just reviewing previous materials, no progress on new topics.
* Realized I want to switch up my learning approach: planning to start reading a book on Linux, focusing on the command line and terminal tools.
* Even during the busiest days, trying to keep up the momentum and stay motivated for steady progress.

